          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516269585496_201095_54536"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the InterfaceConnectorOccurrence. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
