        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516205796112_413456_103664"/>
        <body>An InterfaceSpecificationDefinition provides a view of an InterfaceSpecification. &lt;example&gt;When developing a BSI standard for connecting domestic electrical equipment to the electricity supply, collected comments from experts form a new view on a version of the standard.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
