        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516204844579_262727_100341"/>
        <body>An InterfaceSpecification provides a definition of necessary attributes for one or more items that participate in an interface. &lt;example&gt;BSI develops a standard for connecting domestic electrical equipment to the electricity supply.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
