        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516272437237_520373_55847" xmi:uuid="53ddd4dc-a7ec-4f41-b18d-14a81638e083" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516272437236_793390_55823"/>
          <body>the other instance of the connected pair of InterfaceConnectorDefinitions or PartView. If one element of the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
        </ownedComment>
