    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990017_261978_54758" xmi:uuid="a575a8d1-07e8-4f0c-8c36-7df2f6f7c997" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990018_825846_54759" xmi:uuid="ff82c031-7a31-4255-987e-f2ac10793548" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990017_261978_54758"/>
        <body>An InterfaceConnector identifies a part of a product with which one or more other products or the environment interacts. &lt;note&gt; This is sometimes referred to as a "port".&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;A computer has a socket to which to connect a network cable. An instance of the InterfaceConnector entity data type identifies the role of the socket in the interface and is the subject of a specification that defines the necessary geometrical and electrical attributes to ensure a functioning interface between the computer and network hardware.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>InterfaceConnector</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990018_463716_54760" xmi:uuid="cad5c91e-6de9-4378-a4d9-fd904652aaaa" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990020_686237_54768" xmi:uuid="2e250f35-a827-4a72-aba2-d806da6d4991" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990018_463716_54760"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the InterfaceConnector. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Id</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193119_518292_23608"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990073_228872_54791"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990019_615354_54761" xmi:uuid="1a4857dc-a68e-440e-802d-054922f72e01" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990021_502059_54772" xmi:uuid="2f3a7e5f-fe17-47f9-9cb2-7b8e17e62127" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1516270990019_615354_54761"/>
          <body> the words or set of words by which the InterfaceConnector is known. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multiple names in different contexts as well as multi-linguism.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Name</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193068_300298_23514"/>
